src/domain/market-impact/uniswapV3Math.js adapts TickMath.sol,
SqrtPriceMath.sol and SwapMath.sol to JavaScript BigInt for bounded,
exact-input research queries. The surrounding quote/replay/collector
code is part of Market Lab. uniswapV3Quote.js also adapts swap traversal
from UniswapV3Pool.sol and TickBitmap.sol. This is not the official Uniswap SDK.

Source: https://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core
